# Rolling rumble techno at 128 BPM: a reese bass through existing effects.
use-bpm 128

# Four-on-the-floor kick.
s :phase-drum > note [:c1 :c1 :c1 :c1] > fm-amount 1.5 > pitch-sweep 0.72 > decay 0.34 > drive 0.3 > gain 0.34 > d1

# Sixteenth-note reese rumble; the room and low-pass are existing voice effects.
s :reese-bass > note [:c1 :c1 :c1 :c1 :c1 :c1 :c1 :c1 :c1 :c1 :c1 :c1 :c1 :c1 :c1 :c1] > gate-length 1.2 > cutoff 420 > room 0.28 > size 0.62 > lpf 900 > gain 0.28 > d2
